!______________________________________________________________________________________________________________________
! SIMULATION CONFIGURATION
Bottom Drag Model == ks 															! {Manning} | ks
Include Salinity == 1,1																! {0} Salinity off | 1 Salinity on, {0} Hydrodynamic density coupling off | 1 Hydrodynamic density coupling on
Include Temperature == 1,1															! {0} Temperature off | 1 Temperature on, {0} Hydrodynamic density coupling off | 1 Hydrodynamic density coupling on
Spatial Order == 1,2																! {1} | 2 Horizontal, {1} | 2 Vertical
Include Heat == 1																	! {0} Atmospheric heat exchange off | 1 Atmospheric heat exchange on
Spherical == 1																		! {0} Cartesian | 1 Long/Lat
NTracer == 1	

!Horizontal Turbulent Mixing
Momentum Mixing Model == Smagorinsky												! None | Constant | Smagorinsky | Wu
Global Horizontal Eddy Viscosity == 0.2												! {0.0} Coeffecient
Global Horizontal Eddy Viscosity Limits == 0.05, 99999.								! {0.0} Minimum eddy viscosity (m^2/s), {99999.} Maximum eddy viscosity (m^2/s)

!Vertical Mixing
Vertical Mixing Model == K-Omega
Vertical Mixing Parameters == 0.55555, 0.075, 0.0768, 2.0, 2.0, 0.0, -0.637117 		! {5/9} alpha, {3/40} beta, {9/100} cmu, {2.} sig_k, {2.} sig_o, {0.} c3oplus, {0.} c3ominus
! Vertical Mixing Limits
Global Vertical Eddy Viscosity Limits == 1.0e-4, 1.0 								! {0.0} Minimum eddy viscosity (m^2/s), {99999.} Maximum eddy viscosity (m^2/s)
Global Vertical Scalar Diffusivity Limits == 0., 1.0 								! {0.0} Minimum scalar diffusivity (m^2/s), {99999.} Maximum scalar diffusivity (m^2/s)
Global Vertical TKE Limit == 1.e-10 												! {1E-10 m^2/s^2} Minimum turbulent kinetic energy
Global Vertical EPS Limit == 1.e-10 												! {1E-14 m^2/s^3} Minimum dissipation rate
! Second Order Vertical Mixing Model
Second Order Vertical Mixing Model == Algebraic 									! {OFF} | Algebraic
Second Order Vertical Mixing Model Parameter Group  == CHCD01A 						! {GL78} | MY86 | KC94 | LDOR96 | CHCD01A | CHCD01B | CCH02)

!3D Geometry Commands - Z-Sigma Hybrid Vertical Layering
Vertical Mesh Type == z																! Fixed z layers
Layer Faces == ..\model\csv\3D_Z_Layers_001.csv										! Z layer definition (mRL)
Surface Sigma Layers == 4															! 4 evenly spaced layers between the water surface and the top z layer
Min Bottom Layer Thickness == 0.5													! (m) Do not allow any z layers below a thickness of 0.5 m
Cell 3D Depth == 1.0																! (m) If the depth in a cell is less than 1.0 m turn off vertical exchanges - i.e. reduce to 2D solution

!______________________________________________________________________________________________________________________
! MATERIAL PROPERTIES
Set Mat == 1																		! Set all materials to 1, overwrite material definition within .2dm
Material == 1																		! Main channel - silt bed
    Bottom Roughness == 0.02														! Nikaradse roughness (m)
End Material
Material == 2																		! Overbank - reeds
    Bottom Roughness == 0.75														! Nikaradse roughness (m)
End Material
Material == 3																		! Overbank - heavy reeds
  Bottom Roughness == 1.3															! Nikaradse roughness (m)
End Material